## About terms of use
zk.about.usage.personal=§6PERSONAL USE AND OPEN DEVELOPMENT
zk.about.usageLabel1=- You may modify and adapt this pack for personal use.
zk.about.usageLabel2=- When sharing changes, keep the credits of ZK UI Pack and the original authors.
zk.about.usageLabel3=- Do not redistribute this pack or modified versions on stores or monetization platforms without permission.
zk.about.usageLabel4=- Do not present the code or assets as your own creation.

